  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1802.45 School",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.45 “School” means any non-profit institution, whether private or public, day or residential, that provides elementary or secondary education, or both, including kindergarten but excluding day care centers.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
